<!-- Nowhere launcher icon (shared/core): the dispersing-spore motif (cf. ChooserActivity.SporeView) on a
     dark disc, teal accent. A single vector drawable; used as the app + Log-off icon. Per-edition overrides
     may recolor it (e.g. editions/endospore ships a gray variant for the GrapheneOS theme).

     SIZING RULE (shared with ic_napps, keep them in step): the glyph's bounding box fills 75% of the
     100-unit disc on its larger dimension, centred on the disc. Measured here: 72% x 75%, furthest dot edge
     at 43.6 = 87% of the radius. That 87% is the up-right dot of the dispersal, which by design reaches
     further than the cluster — it is inside the rim, but this motif has less headroom than ic_napps, so
     enlarge it further only after looking at it on a device.

     DIA-20260816-22: was 62% x 65%. Enlarged x1.150 about the glyph's own bbox centre, then recentred on the
     disc, so it matches nApps and reads like the platform icons next to it (Clock and friends sit at roughly
     75% glyph / 25% margin; at 65% ours looked like a small mark adrift on a big disc). -->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">
    <!-- dark disc background (brand canvas #0B0F14) -->
    <path android:fillColor="#0B0F14"
        android:pathData="M54,54 m-50,0 a50,50 0 1,0 100,0 a50,50 0 1,0 -100,0 Z" />
    <!-- dispersing spore: dots rising/scattering up-right, teal accent + ink white -->
    <path android:fillColor="#4FD6AC"
        android:pathData="M50.66,80 m-11.5,0 a11.5,11.5 0 1,0 23.01,0 a11.5,11.5 0 1,0 -23.01,0 Z" />
